WEBVTT

01:07:01.759 --> 01:07:05.845
Because if you don't,
we'll find out, Sid.

01:07:06.347 --> 01:07:12.268
We toys can see everything.

01:07:13.437 --> 01:07:15.814
So play nice.

01:07:22.071 --> 01:07:25.615
We did it! We did it! Yes!

01:07:25.700 --> 01:07:28.326
The toys!
The toys are alive!

01:07:28.619 --> 01:07:30.078
Nice toy.
